      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Causes of vertebrogenic back pain are described. Differential diagnosis in this condition is important as visceral pathology may underlie the pain syndrome. Algorithm of the patient examination is given. Paraclinic examination is important but in diagnosis clinical examination is of key value. Pharmacological and non-pharmacological treatment approaches are considered."},
